{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_architecture_architecture_and_integration_house_room_architecture", "label": "House-and-room integration architecture", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/architecture/architecture-and-integration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The chatbot is the house, the advisor a room that lights up only for edge-hardware questions. In-process library chosen over a separate microservice (extra moving part to deploy and break) and over MCP model-invoked tools (the chatbot has no tool-calling layer; adding one is a big change). Everything sits behind a single ADVISOR_ENABLED switch so the original chatbot survives untouched."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_architecture_and_integration_rag_docs_chameleon", "label": "RAG-docs-chameleon chatbot", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/architecture-and-integration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Streamlit retrieve-then-generate app over Chameleon documentation: FAISS doc index + bge embeddings + reranker, PRIMARY/SUPPLEMENTARY context assembly, answer via a local LLM with source links."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_architecture_and_integration_advisor_room", "label": "advisor_room.py wrapper", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/architecture-and-integration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Exposes exactly the two things the chatbot needs \u2014 should_fire(question) and advise(question) \u2014 making the seam literally one Python import."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_architecture_and_integration_should_fire_gate", "label": "should_fire edge-question gate", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/architecture/architecture-and-integration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cheap check on every question that requires BOTH an edge cue word AND a router topic score above threshold, so general documentation questions never wake the room. Added after a general SSH/floating-IP question scored identically (2.25) to the edge-SSH artifact \u2014 a deliberate precision-over-recall trade."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_architecture_and_integration_edge_resource_advisory_injection", "label": "EDGE RESOURCE ADVISORY context injection", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/architecture/architecture-and-integration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The advisor's recommendation is appended to the chatbot context under a labelled '=== EDGE RESOURCE ADVISORY ===' header matching the existing PRIMARY/SUPPLEMENTARY idiom, so the LLM treats it as one more trusted context section and produces a single unified, source-grounded answer."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_architecture_and_integration_bge_embeddings", "label": "Shared BAAI/bge-large-en-v1.5 embedding space", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/architecture-and-integration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Both systems embed text with the same model, so the advisor's notion of relevance lives in the same mathematical space as the chatbot's and gate scores are meaningful; asserted at startup \u2014 fails loudly if the advisor ever falls back to a different embedder."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_architecture_and_integration_local_llm", "label": "Local LLM brain (Ollama Qwen2.5-32B)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/architecture/architecture-and-integration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "After losing access to hosted Llama-3.3-70B, one self-hosted Qwen2.5-32B on the 2x P100 node serves both the chatbot's answering step and the advisor's reasoning step through one shared OpenAI-style endpoint \u2014 one brain for house and room; embeddings and reranker stay on CPU to leave GPU memory for the LLM."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_architecture_architecture_and_integration_house_room_architecture", "target": "docs_architecture_architecture_and_integration_rag_docs_chameleon", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/architecture/architecture-and-integration.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_architecture_architecture_and_integration_house_room_architecture", "target": "chi_edge_advisor_readme_chi_edge_advisor", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/architecture/architecture-and-integration.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_architecture_architecture_and_integration_advisor_room", "target": "docs_architecture_architecture_and_integration_house_room_architecture", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/architecture/architecture-and-integration.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_architecture_architecture_and_integration_advisor_room", "target": "docs_architecture_architecture_and_integration_should_fire_gate", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/architecture/architecture-and-integration.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_architecture_architecture_and_integration_should_fire_gate", "target": "docs_architecture_architecture_and_integration_edge_resource_advisory_injection", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/architecture/architecture-and-integration.md", "source_location": null, "weig